# What this module is

Android TV interface for Universal Installer, designed for large screen displays and 10-foot UI.
Provides D-pad navigable APK installation, tracked app updates, device storage status, and TV sync.
`install` always means writing an application package onto this TV device.

Derived: 172 translatable string(s) (+3 translatable="false") across 17 locale(s), in `strings.xml`.

## Audience & tone

Clear, concise, and optimized for TV remote navigation.
Short labels for buttons and menu actions so they fit TV cards and rows without truncation.
Use direct register: `vi` uses "bạn", `pt-BR` uses "você".

## Do not translate

- Shizuku
- Dhizuku
- Universal Installer
- APK
- TV

